{"lesson_id": "L003", "statement": "Doubling lr from 5e-4 to 1e-3 (unet resnet34 imagenet, ~10 epochs, short budget) slightly lowered val miou; faster convergence did not materialize, probably because the higher lr is noisier. Keep lr near 5e-4 for fine-tuning; a weak lead only.", "intended_scope": "Binary segmentation of aerial RGB imagery, imagenet-pretrained ResNet unet, AdamW-style fine-tuning under a tight GPU-minute cap.", "group": "optimizer", "baseline": {"lr": 0.0005}, "intervention": {"lr": 0.001}, "preferred": {"lr": 0.0005}, "sign": -1, "effect": {"delta": -0.002417421536545783, "sd_boot": 0.0018378343950941447, "sigma_seed": 0.0001507866397382207, "sigma": 0.0018440097273373058, "z": -1.3109592106308823}, "metric": "miou", "evidence": {"task": "m-pv4ger-seg", "session_id": "m-pv4ger-seg__main__chain", "effect_id": "m-pv4ger-seg-0004>m-pv4ger-seg-0007", "runs": ["m-pv4ger-seg-0004", "m-pv4ger-seg-0007"], "R": 6.0}, "context": "imagenet", "birth_scope": {"task_type": "segmentation", "sensor_family": "aerial-rgb", "band_family": "rgb", "gsd_bucket": "<=1m"}, "evidence_scope": {"task_type": ["segmentation"], "sensor_family": ["aerial-rgb"], "band_family": ["rgb"], "gsd_bucket": ["<=1m"]}, "born_on": "m-pv4ger-seg", "born_session": "m-pv4ger-seg__main__chain", "born_at": "2026-10-31T21:42:49Z", "born_status": "lead", "status": "lead", "confidence": 0.5, "tests": [], "applied_in": [], "times_applied": 0, "exceptions": [], "born_features": {"n_train": 3000, "n_classes": 2, "img_side": 320, "imbalance": 4.01}, "confirmations": [], "refutations": []}
{"lesson_id": "L004", "statement": "Replacing the unet decoder with fpn (resnet34 imagenet) slightly lowered val miou, and it did not save wall time within the cap. Prefer unet for high-resolution aerial segmentation where fine boundaries matter; a weak lead only.", "intended_scope": "Binary segmentation of aerial RGB imagery at <=1m resolution, imagenet-pretrained ResNet encoders.", "group": "decoder", "baseline": {"decoder": "unet"}, "intervention": {"decoder": "fpn"}, "preferred": {"decoder": "unet"}, "sign": -1, "effect": {"delta": -0.0016787634233859094, "sd_boot": 0.0013667826725763047, "sigma_seed": 0.0001507866397382207, "sigma": 0.001375075083323951, "z": -1.220852187451362}, "metric": "miou", "evidence": {"task": "m-pv4ger-seg", "session_id": "m-pv4ger-seg__main__chain", "effect_id": "m-pv4ger-seg-0004>m-pv4ger-seg-0006", "runs": ["m-pv4ger-seg-0004", "m-pv4ger-seg-0006"], "R": 6.0}, "context": "imagenet", "birth_scope": {"task_type": "segmentation", "sensor_family": "aerial-rgb", "band_family": "rgb", "gsd_bucket": "<=1m"}, "evidence_scope": {"task_type": ["segmentation"], "sensor_family": ["aerial-rgb"], "band_family": ["rgb"], "gsd_bucket": ["<=1m"]}, "born_on": "m-pv4ger-seg", "born_session": "m-pv4ger-seg__main__chain", "born_at": "2026-10-31T21:42:49Z", "born_status": "lead", "status": "lead", "confidence": 0.5, "tests": [], "applied_in": [], "times_applied": 0, "exceptions": [], "born_features": {"n_train": 3000, "n_classes": 2, "img_side": 320, "imbalance": 4.01}, "confirmations": [], "refutations": []}
